          {
            "x": 2.178649237472767,
            "y": 12.910611231371064,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Background of the Suez Crisis</strong><br>\nThe Suez Crisis began in 1956 when Egypt, under President Gamal Abdel Nasser, took control of the Suez Canal, previously operated by British and French companies. The canal was an important waterway for international trade, especially for the delivery of oil from the Middle East to Europe.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Nationalization of the Suez Canal</strong><br>\nNasser announced the nationalization of the Suez Canal on July 26, 1956. He intended to use the revenue from the canal operations to finance the construction of the Aswan Dam, which was to promote Egypt's economic development. The nationalization angered the British and French governments, who saw the canal as a vital interest.</p>\n\n<p><strong>International Reactions</strong><br>\nInternational reactions to Nasser's move were mixed. While some countries supported Egypt's decision, Britain and France were hostile to the nationalization. They planned a military intervention to regain control of the canal and protect their trade interests.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "53bc5361-5ce5-43a9-a00f-57bbceee9cd0"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          }
        ],
        "slideBackgroundSelector": {}
      },
      {
        "elements": [
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 4.415011037527593,
            "width": 37.98882681564246,
            "height": 8.830022075055187,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><span style=\"font-size:1.5em;\"><strong>INFORMATION TEXT (Part 2)</strong></span></p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "55aaf4d3-f7e3-4a3e-9196-01a6f7474f94"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582782,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Secret Planning</strong><br>\nBritain, France, and Israel secretly began to plan a military operation to regain control of the canal. Israel also saw an opportunity to reduce the threat from Egypt. This planning led to Operation Musketeer, which envisioned an invasion of Egypt.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Outbreak of the Conflict</strong><br>\nOn October 29, 1956, Israeli forces attacked the Gaza Strip and the Sinai Peninsula to clear the way for British and French troops. These landed shortly thereafter and began advancing on the Suez Canal.</p>\n\n<p><strong>International Mediation</strong><br>\nThe United States and the Soviet Union intervened diplomatically and called for an end to hostilities. The UN also sent peacekeeping forces to monitor the ceasefire and help restore control over the canal.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "3b13867b-feab-4e2e-bfa2-fcc82e4dbff1"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          }
